    "reviews": "\u201c...this is a classic-style FPS, but oh so much more deadlier, and presented with some charmingly enormous pixels.\u201d<br>RockPaperShotgun<br><br>\u201cWe've seen a few other classic FPSes on this list and Gorescript fits right at home among them, a lot of fun in its own right.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cKeen understanding of both what made the arcade FPS of yesteryear great, and what could make it better: a rare homage in spirit over form.\u201d<br>7/10 \u2013 OpNoobs<br>",
